  "body": "https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#local-scheme and https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#is-local don’t seem to be used anywhere in the URL spec. Are they intended for use from other specs? If so, perhaps a note linking to the relevant documents could be added. If not, these definitions could be removed.\n",
